  "details": "(FIXED) I worked it out, you need to force a driver clean install for NVIDIA give it a google for instructions.\n\nVRCHAT open in windowed or full screen, after the latest patch on PC my Screen is crashing its odd only with VRC open the screen fritezes out like it has a bad cable and goes black then comes back for a second and repeats. This is only with VRC open.\n\nI can supply a video from my mobile of this happening and hardware details if required. I have ensured that unity is not running in the background before launch no change.\n\nProcessor\tAMD Ryzen 5 5600T \n\nGPU Name\tNVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 Driver 617.14\n\nBoard Model\tB550M DS3H AC R2\n\nRAM                DDR4 32GB 2666 MT/s 50% Usage at time of game start.\n\nGame ran from a HDD, SSD & M.2 same issue.\n\nFor more details feel free to reach out.",
